{"id":"communication","title":"6. IPC & Communication","phase":null,"phaseName":null,"category":"Documentation","subcategory":"communication","language":"markdown","description":"Zero-latency JSON-RPC over stdin/stdout IPC communication protocols between Node.js CAP and Python AI agent.","sections":[],"content":"<h2>Stdin/Stdout JSON-RPC Mechanism</h2><p>The <strong>BookShop Multi-Buildpack</strong> application leverages Cloud Foundry multi-buildpack co-location. Instead of maintaining a separate HTTP server with port-allocation overhead, Node.js and Python communicate via high-performance <strong>newline-delimited JSON-RPC over <code>stdin</code>/<code>stdout</code></strong> with <strong>0ms cold start</strong> per request.</p><div class=\"docs-diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 840\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\"> <defs> <linearGradient id=\"canvas-bg\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0b0f19\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#111827\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"step-grad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#1e293b\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0f172a\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"gateway-grad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#042f2e\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0f766e\" /> </linearGradient> <filter id=\"soft-shadow\" x=\"-5%\" y=\"-5%\" width=\"110%\" height=\"110%\"> <feDropShadow dx=\"0\" dy=\"8\" stdDeviation=\"12\" flood-color=\"#000000\" flood-opacity=\"0.5\" /> </filter> <marker id=\"arr-teal\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#2dd4bf\" /> </marker> <marker id=\"arr-blue\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" /> </marker> <marker id=\"arr-amber\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" /> </marker> <style> .txt-title { font-family: 'Ubuntu', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; fill: #ffffff; } .txt-sub { font-family: 'Ubuntu', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; fill: #94a3b8; } .txt-hdr { font-family: 'Ubuntu', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: #ffffff; } .txt-body { font-family: 'Ubuntu', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; fill: #e2e8f0; } .txt-dim { font-family: 'Ubuntu', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; fill: #94a3b8; } .txt-code { font-family: 'Ubuntu Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; fill: #38bdf8; } .txt-pill { font-family: 'Ubuntu', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; } .flow-line { stroke-dasharray: 6,4; animation: dash 1.5s linear infinite; } @keyframes dash { to { stroke-dashoffset: -20; } } </style> </defs> <!-- Background Base Canvas --> <rect width=\"1280\" height=\"840\" fill=\"url(#canvas-bg)\" rx=\"18\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <!-- Header Section --> <text x=\"640\" y=\"42\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-title\">End-to-End AI Request &amp; LangGraph Execution Lifecycle</text> <text x=\"640\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">From Client HTTP Call ➔ Node.js Edge Gateway ➔ Zero-Latency IPC ➔ LangGraph Agent Pipeline ➔ 4-Destination LLM Failover</text> <!-- Step 1: Client Ingress (x: 30, w: 220) --> <g transform=\"translate(30, 95)\" filter=\"url(#soft-shadow)\"> <rect width=\"220\" height=\"715\" fill=\"url(#step-grad)\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"14\" /> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"18\" width=\"190\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#64748b\" /> <text x=\"110\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\">1. Client Request</text> <!-- Request Types --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 68)\"> <rect width=\"190\" height=\"95\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#334155\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#38bdf8\">AI Ingress Endpoints</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"44\" class=\"txt-code\">POST /ai/ask</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"64\" class=\"txt-code\">POST /ai/ask_rag</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"84\" class=\"txt-code\">POST /ai/ask_agent</text> </g> <g transform=\"translate(15, 178)\"> <rect width=\"190\" height=\"90\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#334155\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#fb923c\">Streaming Endpoint</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"46\" class=\"txt-code\">POST /ai/ask/stream</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"68\" class=\"txt-dim\">Server-Sent Events (SSE)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"84\" class=\"txt-dim\">text/event-stream chunks</text> </g> <g transform=\"translate(15, 283)\"> <rect width=\"190\" height=\"150\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#334155\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#a7f3d0\">JSON Payload</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"48\" class=\"txt-code\">{\"prompt\": \"...\",</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"68\" class=\"txt-code\"> \"model\": \"...\"}</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"96\" class=\"txt-dim\">Auth Header:</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"114\" class=\"txt-code\">Authorization: Bearer</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"132\" class=\"txt-dim\">&lt;XSUAA JWT Token&gt;</text> </g> <g transform=\"translate(15, 448)\"> <rect width=\"190\" height=\"245\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#022c22\" stroke=\"#059669\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"26\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#6ee7b7\">Client Expectations</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"52\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Direct completion: &lt; 2s</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"74\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Cached completion: &lt; 5ms</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"96\" class=\"txt-dim\">• SSE time-to-first-token: &lt; 400ms</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"118\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Grounded catalog answers</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"140\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Zero jailbreak vulnerability</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"162\" class=\"txt-code\">Content-Type: app/json</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"184\" class=\"txt-code\">X-RateLimit: 15/min</text> </g> </g> <!-- Step 2: Node.js Edge Gateway (x: 275, w: 235) --> <g transform=\"translate(275, 95)\" filter=\"url(#soft-shadow)\"> <rect width=\"235\" height=\"715\" fill=\"url(#gateway-grad)\" stroke=\"#2dd4bf\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"14\" /> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"18\" width=\"205\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#042f2e\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" /> <text x=\"117\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#ffffff\">2. Node.js Gateway</text> <!-- Subcard 1: Rate Limiting & Auth --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 68)\"> <rect width=\"205\" height=\"110\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#042f2e\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#5eead4\">Security Gatekeeper</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"44\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Sliding rate limit (15 req/min)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"62\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Helmet CSP &amp; CORS validation</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"80\" class=\"txt-dim\">• XSUAA JWT signature check</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"98\" class=\"txt-code\">srv/server.js</text> </g> <!-- Subcard 2: Auto Destination Select --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 193)\"> <rect width=\"205\" height=\"135\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#042f2e\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#5eead4\">Auto-Destination Resolution</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"46\" class=\"txt-dim\">• @sap-cloud-sdk/connectivity</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"66\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Auto-queries BTP destination</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"86\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Ingests URL &amp; API Key</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"106\" class=\"txt-dim\">• In-memory caching</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"124\" class=\"txt-code\">srv/ai-destination.js</text> </g> <!-- Subcard 3: Zero-Latency IPC Bridge --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 343)\"> <rect width=\"205\" height=\"160\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#042f2e\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#5eead4\">Zero-Latency IPC Bridge</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"46\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Single persistent Python proc</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"66\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Stdin newline JSON-RPC</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"86\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Stdout JSON / SSE chunks</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"106\" class=\"txt-dim\">• 0ms cold start per request</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"126\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Ping / pong health check</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"146\" class=\"txt-code\">srv/python.js</text> </g> <!-- Subcard 4: Probe Responses --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 518)\"> <rect width=\"205\" height=\"175\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#042f2e\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#5eead4\">Probes Monitoring</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"48\" class=\"txt-code\">GET /healthz</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"66\" class=\"txt-dim\">➔ {\"status\":\"OK\"}</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"94\" class=\"txt-code\">GET /readyz</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"112\" class=\"txt-dim\">➔ {\"status\":\"READY\",</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"130\" class=\"txt-dim\"> \"python\":\"OK\"}</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"156\" class=\"txt-code\">Kubernetes / CF Probes</text> </g> </g> <!-- Step 3: Python LangGraph Agent Subsystems (x: 535, w: 450) --> <g transform=\"translate(535, 95)\" filter=\"url(#soft-shadow)\"> <rect width=\"450\" height=\"715\" fill=\"url(#step-grad)\" stroke=\"#60a5fa\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"14\" /> <rect x=\"20\" y=\"18\" width=\"410\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" /> <text x=\"225\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#38bdf8\">3. Python LangGraph Agent Execution Pipeline</text> <!-- Subsystem A --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 68)\"> <rect width=\"420\" height=\"78\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#67e8f9\">🛡️ Phase A: Defense-in-Depth Input Guardrails</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"46\" class=\"txt-dim\">Direct &amp; indirect prompt injection scanner • Jailbreak signature detector</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"66\" class=\"txt-code\">PII Redaction: Emails, Cards, JWTs, API Keys automatically masked</text> </g> <!-- Subsystem B --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 156)\"> <rect width=\"420\" height=\"78\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#67e8f9\">⚡ Phase B: Enterprise Redis Prompt Cache Lookup</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"46\" class=\"txt-dim\">SHA-256 (model:prompt) key signature check against SAP BTP redis-instance</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"66\" class=\"txt-code\">&lt; 5ms Cached Response Hit ➔ Skips LLM invocation (1h TTL)</text> </g> <!-- Subsystem C --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 244)\"> <rect width=\"420\" height=\"88\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#34d399\">📐 Phase C: SAP HANA Cloud Vector RAG Engine</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"46\" class=\"txt-dim\">REAL_VECTOR(1536) Embeddings ➔ COSINE_SIMILARITY() catalog query</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"66\" class=\"txt-dim\">Context Token Compression: Normalizes whitespace &amp; limits context (50%+ token savings)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"82\" class=\"txt-code\">python/agent/rag.py</text> </g> <!-- Subsystem D --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 342)\"> <rect width=\"420\" height=\"88\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#a78bfa\">🧠 Phase D: LangGraph Stateful Agent Workflow</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"46\" class=\"txt-dim\">StateGraph pipeline: Preserves chat_history across multi-turn user conversations</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"66\" class=\"txt-dim\">Tool Nodes: Dynamic catalog stock validation &amp; discount calculation tools</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"82\" class=\"txt-code\">python/agent/graph.py</text> </g> <!-- Subsystem E --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 440)\"> <rect width=\"420\" height=\"135\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#fbbf24\">🔄 Phase E: Multi-Model Router &amp; Failover Cascade</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"46\" class=\"txt-dim\">Automated failover chain across the 4 configured SAP BTP model destinations:</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"58\" width=\"88\" height=\"28\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#064e3b\" stroke=\"#34d399\" /> <text x=\"59\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-dim\" fill=\"#a7f3d0\">1. Gemma 26B</text> <text x=\"110\" y=\"77\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#94a3b8\">➔</text> <rect x=\"122\" y=\"58\" width=\"85\" height=\"28\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#0c4a6e\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" /> <text x=\"164\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-dim\" fill=\"#bae6fd\">2. Gemma 31B</text> <text x=\"214\" y=\"77\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#94a3b8\">➔</text> <rect x=\"226\" y=\"58\" width=\"80\" height=\"28\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#4c1d95\" stroke=\"#c084fc\" /> <text x=\"266\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-dim\" fill=\"#e9d5ff\">3. GLM 5.2</text> <text x=\"313\" y=\"77\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#94a3b8\">➔</text> <rect x=\"325\" y=\"58\" width=\"80\" height=\"28\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#7c2d12\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" /> <text x=\"365\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-dim\" fill=\"#fed7aa\">4. Mistral</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"105\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Exponential Backoff: Retries failed calls (1s ➔ 2s ➔ 4s delays)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"123\" class=\"txt-code\">python/agent/llm_router.py</text> </g> <!-- Subsystem F --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 585)\"> <rect width=\"420\" height=\"108\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#042f2e\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#a7f3d0\">🛡️ Phase F: Output Guardrails &amp; Response Serialization</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"46\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Output Groundedness Validator: Verifies content stays within bookshop domain</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"66\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Competitor Name Redactor: Filters out forbidden competitor brands</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"86\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Asynchronous LangSmith Telemetry Tracing logged in background</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"102\" class=\"txt-code\">Emits JSON response / SSE token chunks over stdout</text> </g> </g> <!-- Step 4: BTP Destinations & Models (x: 1010, w: 240) --> <g transform=\"translate(1010, 95)\" filter=\"url(#soft-shadow)\"> <rect width=\"240\" height=\"715\" fill=\"url(#step-grad)\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"14\" /> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"18\" width=\"210\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#431407\" stroke=\"#f97316\" /> <text x=\"120\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#fed7aa\">4. BTP Destinations</text> <!-- P1 Model Card --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 68)\"> <rect width=\"210\" height=\"145\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#064e3b\" stroke=\"#34d399\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#a7f3d0\">🥇 Priority 1 (Primary)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"46\" class=\"txt-body\">google-diffusiongemma</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"66\" class=\"txt-code\" fill=\"#6ee7b7\">diffusiongemma-26b</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"86\" class=\"txt-dim\">Top choice for creative</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"104\" class=\"txt-dim\">and structured responses</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"128\" class=\"txt-code\">NVIDIA Foundation</text> </g> <!-- P2 Model Card --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 223)\"> <rect width=\"210\" height=\"145\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0c4a6e\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#bae6fd\">🥈 Priority 2 (P2)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"46\" class=\"txt-body\">google-gemma-4-31b-it</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"66\" class=\"txt-code\" fill=\"#7dd3fc\">gemma-4-31b-it</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"86\" class=\"txt-dim\">High reasoning capability</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"104\" class=\"txt-dim\">and instruction accuracy</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"128\" class=\"txt-code\">NVIDIA Foundation</text> </g> <!-- P3 Model Card --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 378)\"> <rect width=\"210\" height=\"145\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#4c1d95\" stroke=\"#c084fc\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#e9d5ff\">🥉 Priority 3</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"46\" class=\"txt-body\">z-ai-glm-5-2</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"66\" class=\"txt-code\" fill=\"#d8b4fe\">z-ai/glm-5.2</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"86\" class=\"txt-dim\">Speed &amp; general knowledge</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"104\" class=\"txt-dim\">secondary fallback target</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"128\" class=\"txt-code\">NVIDIA Foundation</text> </g> <!-- P4 Fallback Model Card --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 533)\"> <rect width=\"210\" height=\"160\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#7c2d12\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#fed7aa\">🛡️ Priority 4 (Fallback)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"46\" class=\"txt-body\">mistralai-mistral</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"66\" class=\"txt-code\" fill=\"#fdba74\">mistral-nemotron</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"86\" class=\"txt-dim\">Designated safety fallback</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"104\" class=\"txt-dim\">guarantees zero-downtime</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"124\" class=\"txt-dim\">catalog assistance</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"146\" class=\"txt-code\">NVIDIA Foundation</text> </g> </g> <!-- Connectors --> <path d=\"M 250,220 L 275,220\" stroke=\"#2dd4bf\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" class=\"flow-line\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-teal)\" /> <path d=\"M 510,220 L 535,220\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" class=\"flow-line\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-blue)\" /> <path d=\"M 985,500 L 1010,500\" stroke=\"#fbbf24\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" class=\"flow-line\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-amber)\" /></svg></div><hr><h2>1. Node.js IPC Manager (<code>srv/python.js</code>)</h2><p>Node.js manages a persistent, lazy-spawned Python child process using Node's native <code>child_process.spawn()</code>:</p><pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">const { spawn } = require(&#039;child_process&#039;)\nconst readline = require(&#039;readline&#039;)\nconst path = require(&#039;path&#039;)\n\nlet pythonProcess = null\nlet pendingRequests = new Map()\nlet requestId = 0\n\nfunction getPythonProcess() {\n  if (pythonProcess &amp;&amp; !pythonProcess.killed) return pythonProcess\n\n  const pyBin = process.env.PYTHON_BIN || &#039;python3&#039;\n  const pyScript = path.resolve(__dirname, &#039;../python/functions.py&#039;)\n\n  pythonProcess = spawn(pyBin, [pyScript, &#039;--worker&#039;], {\n    stdio: [&#039;pipe&#039;, &#039;pipe&#039;, &#039;inherit&#039;],\n    env: { ...process.env, PYTHONUNBUFFERED: &#039;1&#039; }\n  })\n\n  const rl = readline.createInterface({ input: pythonProcess.stdout })\n  rl.on(&#039;line&#039;, (line) =&gt; {\n    try {\n      const response = JSON.parse(line)\n      const callback = pendingRequests.get(response.id)\n      if (callback) {\n        pendingRequests.delete(response.id)\n        if (response.error) callback.reject(new Error(response.error))\n        else callback.resolve(response.result)\n      }\n    } catch (err) {\n      console.error(&#039;Failed to parse Python IPC output:&#039;, err)\n    }\n  })\n\n  return pythonProcess\n}\n\nasync function callPython(method, params) {\n  const proc = getPythonProcess()\n  const id = ++requestId\n  const payload = JSON.stringify({ jsonrpc: &#039;2.0&#039;, id, method, params }) + &#039;\\n&#039;\n\n  return new Promise((resolve, reject) =&gt; {\n    pendingRequests.set(id, { resolve, reject })\n    proc.stdin.write(payload)\n  })\n}\n\nmodule.exports = { callPython }</code></pre><hr><h2>2. Python Worker Listener (<code>python/functions.py</code>)</h2><p>The Python process runs a persistent loop reading newline-delimited JSON requests from <code>sys.stdin</code>:</p><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import sys\nimport json\nfrom agent.graph import run_agent\nfrom agent.rag import search_books_rag\n\ndef handle_request(req):\n    method = req.get(&quot;method&quot;)\n    params = req.get(&quot;params&quot;, {})\n    \n    if method == &quot;calculate_discount&quot;:\n        title = params.get(&quot;title&quot;, &quot;&quot;)\n        # Calculate dynamic discount factor\n        return {&quot;discount&quot;: 0.15, &quot;eligible&quot;: True}\n        \n    elif method == &quot;ask_agent&quot;:\n        return run_agent(params.get(&quot;prompt&quot;), params.get(&quot;model&quot;))\n        \n    elif method == &quot;ask_rag&quot;:\n        return search_books_rag(params.get(&quot;prompt&quot;), params.get(&quot;model&quot;))\n        \n    raise ValueError(f&quot;Unknown RPC method: {method}&quot;)\n\ndef main():\n    if &quot;--worker&quot; in sys.argv:\n        for line in sys.stdin:\n            if not line.strip():\n                continue\n            try:\n                req = json.loads(line)\n                res = handle_request(req)\n                response = {&quot;jsonrpc&quot;: &quot;2.0&quot;, &quot;id&quot;: req.get(&quot;id&quot;), &quot;result&quot;: res}\n            except Exception as e:\n                response = {&quot;jsonrpc&quot;: &quot;2.0&quot;, &quot;id&quot;: req.get(&quot;id&quot;), &quot;error&quot;: str(e)}\n            sys.stdout.write(json.dumps(response) + &quot;\\n&quot;)\n            sys.stdout.flush()\n\nif __name__ == &quot;__main__&quot;:\n    main()</code></pre><hr><h2>3. JSON-RPC Protocol Specification</h2><h3>Request Frame (Node.js $\\rightarrow$ Python via <code>stdin</code>):</h3><br><pre><code class=\"language-json\">{\n  &quot;jsonrpc&quot;: &quot;2.0&quot;,\n  &quot;id&quot;: 42,\n  &quot;method&quot;: &quot;ask_agent&quot;,\n  &quot;params&quot;: {\n    &quot;prompt&quot;: &quot;What discounts are available for classic literature?&quot;,\n    &quot;model&quot;: &quot;google/diffusiongemma-26b-a4b-it&quot;\n  }\n}</code></pre><h3>Response Frame (Python $\\rightarrow$ Node.js via <code>stdout</code>):</h3><br><pre><code class=\"language-json\">{\n  &quot;jsonrpc&quot;: &quot;2.0&quot;,\n  &quot;id&quot;: 42,\n  &quot;result&quot;: {\n    &quot;response&quot;: &quot;Classic literature titles enjoy a 15% promotional discount.&quot;,\n    &quot;model_used&quot;: &quot;google/diffusiongemma-26b-a4b-it&quot;,\n    &quot;cached&quot;: false,\n    &quot;latency_ms&quot;: 240\n  }\n}</code></pre><hr><h2>Advantages of Co-located Stdin/Stdout IPC</h2><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Stdin/Stdout JSON-RPC (Co-located)</th><th>HTTP Microservice Approach</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Memory Footprint</strong></td><td>Single 512 MB Droplet</td><td>2+ droplets ($2 \\times 512$ MB min)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cold Start</strong></td><td><strong>0ms</strong> (single persistent worker)</td><td>3–10s per cold droplet</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Port Exposure</strong></td><td>Internal only (No external attack vector)</td><td>HTTP port must be routed/secured</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Network Latency</strong></td><td><strong>&lt; 1ms</strong> OS pipe buffer</td><td>15–80ms HTTP network roundtrip</td></tr><tr><td><strong>BTP Cost</strong></td><td>Single App Instance quota</td><td>Multiple App Subscriptions</td></tr></tbody></table></div>","tags":["communication","sap-btp","multi-buildpack","cap","nodejs","python"],"details":""}